4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n-QpXJzndYAQ7kNvwGhXrU-&_nc_oc=Adqh3oW8n45agTQ0nhugF0DrQEmqKlDPmFZr0nt6n-FI4JY6mqPcyNg-w-YSsFQDiSQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-VIX9mNH5DI6nqDBNOzU9soPjNnDMtKdesOXmdZPfjLw&oe=6A411BD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J4JyfnOTZXkQ7kNvwGssQvq&_nc_oc=Ado2sdyPudAPYE0FtVnxf8WGvNEegnhqS8gyYW5o_EXUBx5G31nnxWu6lYNwErHsD70&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_7yMbzYn5UCARZxz0rXa3-ME5ZJke_WJ4B4MsUaCQlAg&oe=6A4120B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VkerRt8qCMUQ7kNvwGLCg2z&_nc_oc=AdptmTcfMGzGBGMtEX-8j6hCHq3zgQVBLDt_SlaDufP-86XvTsqApwVSN2SC4OBb02g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_WBFia8kC8mpL5FiikbV-Pfw_WI6QVIInJyFZlBUwZaQ&oe=6A412E55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p